Stop praying!  You get artifact weapons by _sacrificing_ at a
co-aligned altar, not praying.  (Crowning being an exception to that) 
When your luck is high and you alignment is good, you tend to get
spellbooks from praying.  You can try and adjust your luck downwards
(kick a few mirrors) if you're interested in other beneficial effects
when you pray, like extra HP and protection.

